ries front we  talked about insights now what we think  about and sort of obsess over is how can  we support an operator or a developer on  call going from that page of duty alert  or that SMS to go all the way through  whatever signals they need to get  through to get to root cause we show the  initial stages of that in terms of  integrating monitoring and logging you  could also see integration between  monitoring and tracing and error  reporting and so we intend to go further  and further  in terms of bringing these tools and  capabilities together and then finally  we talked about cloud platform and how  we embrace Google cloud AWS and we  intend to support additional platforms  as you tell us that you want us to and  so thank you very much for your time you  can try Google stackdriver free in beta  right now and if you have any questions  we'll be at the infrastructure and  operations booth out in the floor thank  you  you
 

